      "title": "Sam Altman says OpenAI won't go public until its AI models are safe",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/technology/artificial-intelligence/sam-altman-says-openai-won-t-go-public-until-its-ai-models-are-safe-126093000447_1.html",
      "description": "Sam Altman said taking OpenAI public while the company is transitioning to more capable models could pressure it to prioritise investor expectations over safety.",
